(18135, 3568, 1, 'Lifting (literal) questions: the answer is on the page in the words of the text; stems such as \"According to the text\", \"What does the writer say\", \"Find a word that means\"; answer in the text\'s own words, as briefly as possible. Thinking (inference) questions: you build the answer and support it with the text; stems such as \"What can you infer\", \"Why do you think\", \"Do you agree\" (or containing infer / suggest); answer with your inference plus the supporting line.', 1, '2026-10-01 01:33:12', '2026-10-01 01:33:12'),
