(18137, 3570, 1, 'Inference: the writer sees the ordinary reader as able and responsible, neither a victim nor ignorant. Evidence: \"A reader who asks who says this, and when, is already doing what a newsroom is paid to do.\"', 1, '2026-10-01 01:33:12', '2026-10-01 01:33:12'),
